    },
    {
      "key": "aa0bbfbbb9f46c435058d1883179d2e85df4447eef978fc2a9a68ed91f3d9c5f",
      "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "text": "Os três apoios contam juntos, cada um com o seu estatuto: separação calibrada 4,44, probabilidade unilateral 0,00000443, limiar 5 sigma. O resultado permanece abaixo dele.",
      "text_sha256": "69b80e6167fe037d194b24171295fa63e60086a1c285d0b780b15aa10dee3ccc",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film1",
          "segment": "nature",
          "cue_index": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "b5929c0b652a5d056d8625c268110223caeedeffe19922001cf69d5ef45d49b3",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The model’s offset is -1.48: not falsified with power. Bayesian evidence uses another scale. Kernel validity holds under hypotheses; nature decides.",
      "text_sha256": "398ba174fda2ab3aa30a3ee218743f3dc3bed461ae3d7ec4e0f0e543451d411b",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film1",
          "segment": "nature",
          "cue_index": 1
        },
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "identity",
          "cue_index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "b7568e1cce5dba8b2f56ec8524bcd9d99db2757f922c3c2bdd87adaa3f068eaa",
      "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "text": "O desvio do modelo é -1,48: não falsificada com poder. Evidência bayesiana usa outra escala. Validade no kernel sob hipóteses; a natureza decide.",
      "text_sha256": "826c1b8c1bad87753b35468f0843a6e2ecf7b7804f494aa630c0d2bdfb4dbdba",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film1",
          "segment": "nature",
          "cue_index": 1
        },
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "identity",
          "cue_index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "fc1971d797bb342544208e6b9c108349f2ee410a107b625b03ae2fa2e4577da4",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The density curve shows how the zero mode’s weight is distributed along the modular coordinate. Breuer’s local gap separates it from the other modes.",
      "text_sha256": "b65d2af4b96f1aee2e60e00ce158b2031fd47328453a7cb8d6a8a22904fc841a",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "sheet",
          "cue_index": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "f9c6891ca41356b271713e2371b25b1ca3f708f9605fb008f176151cb8a686d5",
      "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "text": "A curva de densidade mostra como o peso do modo zero se distribui na coordenada modular. O gap local de Breuer o separa dos demais modos.",
      "text_sha256": "e8e36b9eb956446e9919e3539460aa47df85b8dc82636734720a151c450498dc",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "sheet",
          "cue_index": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "99037af49dadf7485d0eaec411b2afa445aee601d9afc072f023095d460f5d42",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The Powers ladder links scales; the coframe supplies local directions. Changes of frame in different directions depend on their order, leaving the rotation shown in the Lorentz relation.",
      "text_sha256": "32a68d0d57b2d1d92655687f70c2ea8cbb3794021a8d429482378f3111c706bf",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "sheet",
          "cue_index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "1163331e39c97334a4673aaa1e70ef6120dd0f445b98632f4cf6a63fffd84dd4",
      "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "text": "A cadeia de Powers liga escalas; o coframe fornece direções locais. Mudanças de referencial em direções diferentes dependem da ordem, deixando a rotação mostrada na relação de Lorentz.",
      "text_sha256": "9cdaeebadb232f057b0acec49859bc839f26ea3cf6e7ad7a89c1208e4160d34b",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "sheet",
          "cue_index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "fc52a19f2184d0a196660325b943bdd403f702349e5180508ff86b2b778c8ab6",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Soldering links the frame to geometry. The generators describe infinitesimal changes of frame; their order leaves the rotation measured by the commutator.",
      "text_sha256": "8121c9db174b5cb875e7e8748ad9966b89ac237ca33b86265389f6c72717d055",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "transport",
          "cue_index": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "41f17dd49fadc32eb3cb0c2388f6f19fd44bcb24aef90d72581a14309055fbd2",
      "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "text": "A solda liga o referencial à geometria. Os geradores descrevem mudanças infinitesimais de referencial; a ordem dessas operações deixa a rotação medida pelo comutador.",
      "text_sha256": "8916fb9c80b08f8e4fb6746a19a810e99e1e7698dfe71492e9d800d460a977b6",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "transport",
          "cue_index": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "7f02ec95e445588f7199befa9b8fee14f622ebf7546eccd40ea6356e8b2998e6",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The loop’s mismatch measures holonomy. The curvature formula relates it to the product of the generator coefficients.",
      "text_sha256": "22c8ba456a01453870598a6a51a685579027a3ffa6577e75c8488251f46f1294",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "transport",
          "cue_index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "0c0597cef8b4fc4ff1bcca1d78c2df6805f2cb0b0d835a58b274828904082224",
      "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "text": "O desajuste ao fechar o circuito mede a holonomia. A fórmula da curvatura o relaciona ao produto dos coeficientes dos geradores.",
      "text_sha256": "aa124f75168a8102262317a81548cdae23abeb5062458149a4db9f233f2b5095",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "transport",
          "cue_index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "441560d5c9b7c08723bfb9f90e7030a65521102c8491d91d8088a9e5a5260dab",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The sheet descends into the throat as the camera follows the static, spherical Schwarzschild geometry. The optical construction shapes the path through the scene.",
      "text_sha256": "9feeb7530f24a689a700e4ae466fbd18a5dac6123d981f9f5052eeda8bc31613",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "throat",
          "cue_index": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "2185be6f2ca6135e2c1156d0a98c8069c3dceab4fb12f812f0fed3b5fcaa8566",
      "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "text": "O lençol desce à garganta enquanto a câmera acompanha a geometria estática e esférica de Schwarzschild. A construção óptica dá forma ao percurso na cena.",
      "text_sha256": "4723448420eb1f2dedbe6fe632dfacb24861eb0e289d74698eb54d6c4726cb0d",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "throat",
          "cue_index": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "69f0f6a0457a57124881f7e42c65d869123e15badefbdfc18c315507fe4a4534",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Beside it, the temporal and radial residuals compare the calculated geometry with the equations. Their displayed values let the viewer follow that check as the horizon comes into view.",
      "text_sha256": "a9dc88adb1a171b242d9f8f6bc2c4bb5ee4896f40b869ceeb81490e52078223f",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "throat",
          "cue_index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "5608c7dc528269c7887ac5e220675df31f821e3806b9c599d07243eac4d0a3eb",
      "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "text": "Ao lado, os resíduos temporal e radial comparam a geometria calculada com as equações. Seus valores exibidos permitem acompanhar essa verificação quando o horizonte aparece.",
      "text_sha256": "1c75b5d6136fd1fee1591a889dab96f2bd262232ba473aa6fb777ca3f0d35633",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "throat",
          "cue_index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "1ca4230748ebbe66b5f470e721a4058bed7fa23e251c49749409045f9f8c4d2b",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Spin describes how the tensor responds when the frame rotates. Opposite helicities give 2 transverse polarizations.",
      "text_sha256": "a36a783d9c933cea533bac320850506c1878d455db3865df2aaf0c801bc55bb5",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "spin",
          "cue_index": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "238cb0c4e7a07403d9e621e5265890fbcb09c38327fcd3bf49a8475f9528e22d",
      "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "text": "O spin descreve como o tensor responde à rotação do referencial. Helicidades opostas dão 2 polarizações transversais.",
      "text_sha256": "b577024d3ef0ca29dfb7a14f8fca7ddef8136212406f22d65c2dfa5217b1320f",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "spin",
          "cue_index": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "511d233b6cf25a39e03dbb0c41ec42cdb5a19c129ed6fe8aa4d788a1d9216dd9",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "As the frame turns, the helix tracks the tensor’s angular phase. Its paired strands make the polarization structure visible while the displayed residual checks the transformation law.",
      "text_sha256": "40cc5bef9028575ea789232bb9602b44fd9b5dad495442b0e3201dcd95321491",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "spin",
          "cue_index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "ea4bee214190956b3a2e83bd845e2154bb0f126bc6d14c8335682bc6343ba75e",
      "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "text": "Quando o referencial gira, a hélice acompanha a fase angular do tensor. Seus ramos tornam visível a estrutura de polarização, enquanto o resíduo exibido verifica a lei de transformação.",
      "text_sha256": "51b05cac52a72e1c981a7ba1797dcec61757ad1289703177da3dea4cb588ad5e",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "spin",
          "cue_index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "db0a64da3c005dee73b39420ec6d78a7bed29dec9c55b44c511f353ae892fd0d",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The first hypothesis requires finite trace of the kernel projection and a local spectral gap; the second, coframe and Lorentz geometry; the third links horizon heat and area through Clausius. Together they form the Pentad.",
      "text_sha256": "fb15132c92710e781b801a7a54a7a345fe5f09b0b981cf42344f1153fc1661a1",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "einstein",
          "cue_index": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "cb99546bd970b7d42717caeb6ad1dfeadb3811394d0e7821178ca3631cfe188f",
      "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "text": "A primeira hipótese exige traço finito da projeção sobre o núcleo e gap espectral local; a segunda, coframe e geometria de Lorentz; a terceira liga calor e área no horizonte por Clausius. Juntas, compõem a Pêntada.",
      "text_sha256": "e6a5b03d7cdabdf157e13539dbb4cebf8364b2a2d6e18bcb6ceaf48fe4f6e7ab",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "einstein",
          "cue_index": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "30d7aea974fbc9500a789fde05781e131532cc8d81e13d3e3d37faf51cc2b20b",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Clausius links heat, surface gravity and area, yielding Einstein’s coefficient. The kernel ladder has 9698 ladder flags (named declarations), all clean; all 18 gate flags are computed, none literal.",
      "text_sha256": "44d52daa1fd032d53f9f2108fdb6db72b183d93c212ee6215cedf30ca8fb26a9",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "einstein",
          "cue_index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "df5849b6a78d541928fc0b95c8baf25a6b064d49f22e8da62a968be134ed19f9",
      "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "text": "Clausius liga calor, gravidade superficial e área, dando o coeficiente de Einstein. A escada do kernel tem 9698 bandeiras da escada (declarações nomeadas), todas limpas; as 18 bandeiras do gate são calculadas, nenhuma literal.",
      "text_sha256": "3b7e9e6008ac063adae1a387f41fa55b14d88426b0df2394164f8175338d0a2c",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "einstein",
          "cue_index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "47c60c35433d42d399bcac083c4e6ca3b1291853e9b1c81cf3510bc55b7b2c05",
      "voice": "en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Identity returns with residual 0. The three supports count together, each with its own status: calibrated separation 4.44, one-sided probability 0.00000443, threshold 5 sigma. The result remains below it.",
      "text_sha256": "da1943c38b975fbde95895b544cdb66bff31135d691292f736dbac4160d51b25",
      "occurrences": [
        {
          "film": "film2",
          "segment": "identity",
          "cue_index": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "38def561d8ea0e0d335f0b80743792c1687a7beb57ad7bfeed39dc063a06d1a3",
      "voice": "pt-BR-AntonioNeural",
      "language": "pt-BR",
      "text": "A identidade retorna com resíduo 0. Os três apoios contam juntos, cada um com o seu estatuto: separação calibrada 4,44, probabilidade unilateral 0,00000443, limiar 5 sigma. O resultado permanece abaixo dele.",
      "text_sha256": "4efda55a1bff09622f3031268a0f44d828dd7894b72698eb5ef9b82d78af8f32",
      "occurrences": [
        {
